### Health Check
GET localhost:8080/api/health

### GET TrackedObjects by ID
GET localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2

### GET request for all tracked objects
GET localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects

### GET only hazardous objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/hazardous

### GET by ID (404)
GET localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/999

### GET count tracked-objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/count

### GET info-text
GET http://localhost:8080/api/info

### PUT - Objekt vollständig ersetzen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "2024 YR4 (revised)",
  "estimatedDiameterKm": 0.098,
  "potentiallyHazardous": true,
  "closeApproachDate": "2032-12-24",
  "missDistanceKm": 3100000.0
}

### POST - neues Objekt anlegen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eros",
  "estimatedDiameterKm": 16.34,
  "potentiallyHazardous": false,
  "closeApproachDate": "2065-10-25",
  "missDistanceKm": 26000000.0
}

### DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2